sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant F as Founder
  participant B as EnsWhite backend
  participant E as Sepolia ENSv2
  participant V as Vendor server
  participant S as Dept + attester signers
  participant R as WBT relayer
  participant C as Whitechain company
  F->>B: Mission and any required purchase approval
  B->>E: Resolve employee and vendor and read current policy
  E-->>B: Wallets, expiry, limits, allowlist and endpoint
  Note over B,E: Reject fired / expired employees and mismatched vendors
  B->>V: POST /work with reserved request ID
  V-->>B: HTTP 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED
  Note over B,V: Check price, network, token, request ID<br/>payTo must be company and vendor field must match ENS
  B->>B: Reserve budget and require approval above threshold
  B->>E: Refresh ENS policy immediately before signing
  B->>S: Department signs EIP-3009 authorization to company<br/>Attester signs request-bound ENS policy
  S-->>B: Payment signature + policy signature
  B->>R: Persist signed transaction, then submit
  R->>C: pay(...) using WBT gas
  Note over R,C: Contract verifies policy signature, expiry, weekly limits,<br/>vendor, call/day limits, replay and token authorization
  C->>C: Receive gross USDT from department<br/>Send 99% to vendor and retain 1% fee<br/>Emit Paid with both ENS namehashes
  C-->>B: Confirmed transaction receipt
  B->>V: Retry /work with PAYMENT-RESPONSE transaction hash
  V->>C: Independently verify the real payment receipt
  C-->>V: Matching request, department, vendor and amount
  V-->>B: Deliver copy / banner / translated FAQ
  B-->>F: Delivered result + books / explorer proof
  Note over B,R: An uncertain broadcast retries the same saved bytes,<br/>not a newly signed payment
